## 💻 9. Practical SQL Example

### 🟢 Find All Statistics in One Query

```sql
SELECT
    COUNT(*) AS total_students,
    SUM(mark) AS total_marks,
    AVG(mark) AS average_marks,
    MIN(mark) AS lowest_mark,
    MAX(mark) AS highest_mark
FROM Students;
```

🎯 **Expected Result:**

| total_students | total_marks | average_marks | lowest_mark | highest_mark |
|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 5 | 423 | 84.6 | 78 | 90 |

✨ One query can calculate all five statistics!

